5. [b]Shipping[/b] - US shipping only. I use Pirateship. Buyer pays shipping from 77346 on any games won. I will combine shipping if you buy multiple games to save you money. Local pickup can be arranged in Houston area, especially for bulk buyers.

6. [b]Payment[/b] - Payment will be via PayPal, unless picking up locally, where cash is an option. [b]Payment is expected within 24 hours after confirmation of the sale.[/b] I reserve the right to cancel the sale if payment is not made in a timely fashion. I am reasonable, but please let me know if there will be a delay in payment for any reason.

7. [b]Pictures[/b] - I have included pictures for the more expensive games, but I'm happy to send pictures if you'd like. Feel free to geekmail me with your requests.

8. [b]Bundle Discount (BUN)[/b] - Some games are marked with a bundle discount and can be purchased immediately at the BUN price (as if it was a BIN) if you have BINed at least one other game from me. If there is already a BIN buyer on a game with a BUN discount, the game is not available for BUN and will go to the person who BINed first.

